T*
(* List append is amortized O\(1\); insert at index 0 is O\(n\).) Tj
T*
(* Dictionary lookups are average O\(1\) backed by open-addressing hash tables.) Tj
T*
(* Sets enforce element uniqueness and provide fast O\(1\) membership testing.) Tj
T*
